
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}


<div class="home-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>About us</h1>
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="~/images/ZephyrusLogo.jpg" alt="Zephyrus Logo" class="img-fluid" />
        </div>
        <p>
            This website has been made as a college homework assignment.
            The tickets you can acquire through this website are NOT real tickets.
        </p>
        <p>
            Zephyrus was a Greek God who represented the West Wind.
            The West Wind is often associated with the coming of spring and warm weather.
            He was a gentle and benevolent god and often promised good fortune to follow him.
            This is why we chose him as the name and face of our airline.
        </p>
        <p>Made by Bradley Sander and Heleen Bonte as an assignment for the course Fullstack Development at Vives Hogeschool Kortrijk</p>
    </div>
</div>
